CoSAI AI Shared Responsibility Framework
  The framework concepts presented on this site (the five architecture layers,
  the eight personas, the four operating models, and the accountability rules)
  are derived from the CoSAI AI Shared Responsibility Framework, a publication
  of the Coalition for Secure AI (CoSAI), a project of OASIS Open. Source and
  version attribution is retained in the "source" field of the relevant
  data/*.json files. The framework is reproduced here for educational and
  reference purposes consistent with CoSAI's open publication goals.
  https://www.coalitionforsecureai.org/

  The industry vertical control schemas (finance, healthcare, insurance, public
  sector, defense, manufacturing) are independently proposed extensions authored
  for this site. They are not part of an official CoSAI release.

